  "$ref": "#/$defs/Reply",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "Generated from Go JSON types by TestWorkerWireSchemas. Uses X-Myce-Start-Gate: host-launch-v3. Checkin/Reply negotiate optional attempt_protocol keyed-attempt-v1; omission retains current one-attempt compatibility. Keyed reports and directives require (id, attempt, session); assignments reference the unchanged job-v1 schema. M1 limits admission to one attempt per worker, not collection size. Cross-field key equality is enforced by the runtime. Omission is never keyed release proof.",
